# Third-party code and runtime package notices

## CalDAV parser lineage

The CalDAV and iCalendar parser in `server/calendar.js` adapts the project
maintainer's own earlier private implementation, written during this project.
That implementation was not present in the verified public upstream prototype.
This notice makes no third-party authorship or license claim for the parser.

